{%- doc -%}
  Bespoke, conversion-focused product page for "%%DOC_PRODUCT%%

  Structural fork of sections/product-vig503-landing.liquid — same
  Apple-style rhythm, same shared hidden cart form + pv-atc-button /
  pv-trust-row snippets, same sticky bar and Alma modal — so the Élite
  pages read as the same store as the Vigilia ones. The range is signalled
  by a warm sand hero and a bronze accent rather than a dark slab: an
  earlier graphite version was rejected by the merchant as too dark, and
  it fought the product photography, which is shot on white.

  Four things are new, and they are the point of the fork:

  1. A continuity matrix (three situations × five functions), so a
     visitor compares outage scenarios without clicking anything. It
     replaces a tabbed simulator the merchant found unclear.
  2. A carte SIM M2M module, sourced verbatim from the merchant-authored
     description of product SIM1ANPA ("Carte SIM M2M Afone 1 An Prépayé -
     Pour centrale Élite").
  3. A Zigbee 3.0 module, held to what the merchant has confirmed: no
     mesh routing (the pack's sensors are battery end devices and don't
     relay), no comparison against 433 MHz radio (it reads as an attack
     on the merchant's own Vigilia and Touch ranges), and no automation
     scenarios (unconfirmed, so out). The EXT501ZIG amplifier extends
     the ZIGBEE network only — not the SA501 RF accessories the centrale
     also accepts. Third-party devices need Zigbee 3.0 AND Tuya, and
     even then non-Daewoo accessories carry no guarantee.
  4. An accessory picker whose steppers re-price every CTA on the page.

  Two facts are deliberately NOT taken from this product's own current
  descriptionHtml, which contradicts the two fiches above and was flagged
  to the merchant, who confirmed both corrections:
  - Cameras are Wi-Fi only. With a SIM installed and the box down, the APP
    stays usable (that is the single difference with Vigilia/Touch, where
    the SIM only carries SMS and calls) — the camera streams do NOT.
    The PA570 description currently claims "accès aux caméras maintenu".
  - Backup battery is 10 h (DAPA501Z fiche), not the 12 h the PA570
    description claims. Merchant confirmed 10 h "par sécurité".

  Single-variant product, so no connectivity toggle and no PVData blob:
  everything the VIG503 fork needed for its Wi-Fi / Wi-Fi+GSM switch is
  dropped here.

  No rating badge and no reviews section: the 68 curated reviews reused
  across the Vigilia pages are Vigilia-family reviews and do not apply to
  the Élite. To be wired to real Élite reviews before this goes live.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign form_id = 'PEForm-' | append: section.id
  assign hero_img_id = 'PEHeroImg-' | append: section.id

  assign variant_has_compare = false
  if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price
    assign variant_has_compare = true
  endif

  assign gallery = product.images
  assign hero_image = product.featured_image | default: gallery[0]

  # Feature images are matched by filename so re-ordering the product
  # gallery in admin can't silently put the interior camera photo on the
  # exterior camera section. Anything unmatched falls back to the hero.
  assign feat_image_1 = hero_image
  assign feat_image_2 = hero_image
  assign feat_image_3 = hero_image
  for img in gallery
    if img.src contains '%%IMG1%%'
      assign feat_image_1 = img
    endif
    if img.src contains 'IP506'
      assign feat_image_2 = img
    endif
    if img.src contains 'Pilotage' or img.src contains 'distance'
      assign feat_image_3 = img
    endif
  endfor

  # Cross-sell: the Starter Pack Élite, looked up by handle for a real
  # photo and a live price rather than a hardcoded figure.
  assign starter_pack = all_products['starter-pack-elite-daewoo']
  assign starter_pack_image = starter_pack.featured_image
  assign starter_pack_price = starter_pack.price_min

  # Upsell: the M2M SIM card designed for this centrale (200 Mo envelope,
  # not the 50 Mo standard one). Same treatment — live price, real link.
  assign sim_card = all_products['carte-sim-m2m-afone-1-an-prepaye-pour-centrale-pa501z']
  assign sim_price = sim_card.price_min

  # Accessory picker. Looked up by handle so price, photo, stock and
  # variant id all come from the catalogue rather than being frozen into
  # the page. Anything unavailable simply doesn't render its card.
  #
  # The merchant asked for a "WSD502Z" — no such reference exists in the
  # catalogue. The Élite-compatible smoke detector is the WSD501, which
  # is what's offered here; flagged to the merchant.
  assign acc_handles = 'amplificateur-dondes-zigbee-pour-centrale-pa501z,contacteur-de-porte-zigbee-wds502z-compatible-avec-la-centrale-pa501z,detecteur-de-vibration-zigbee-wvd502z-compatible-avec-la-centrale-pa501z,detecteur-de-fumee-wsd501-pour-alarme-daewoo-sa501' | split: ','

  assign has_rating = false
-%}
